{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "scene_id": "ruan_tongchen_due_process",
  "title": "阮同尘的到期令",
  "entry_node": "rtc_line_01",
  "participants": ["protagonist", "ruan_tongchen"],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "rtc_line_01",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "ruan_tongchen",
      "expression": "measured",
      "outfit": "night_contract_officer",
      "text": "我可以先签止扣令，但不能把六百三十一份案子压成一句‘全部违法’。已经还清的、仍在还的、失联的、未成年人和无法表达的人，必须各有一栏，各有证据和期限。",
      "next": "rtc_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "rtc_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "rtc_choice_split_cases",
          "text": "按本人、机构和待核证据分案，先保药、工资、护理与住居，再逐项追问授权、得利和早知不对者。",
          "next": "rtc_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "ruan_tongchen", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "ruan_tongchen_case_split_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rtc_choice_fast_blanket_order",
          "text": "先用一张总令冻结所有续扣，等资源压力过去后再补每个人的证据和送达记录。",
          "next": "rtc_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "ruan_tongchen", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "ruan_tongchen_blanket_order_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rtc_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "protagonist",
      "expression": "firm",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "程序不是把人拖到最后才允许活下去的门槛。先把今天会断的药、工资和住处保护住，再让每一项责任都留下可追问的名字、期限和证据。",
      "next": "rtc_effect_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "rtc_effect_01",
      "type": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "ruan_tongchen_due_process_preserved", "value": true},
        {"type": "character_expression", "character_id": "ruan_tongchen", "expression": "resolute"}
      ],
      "next": "rtc_end"
    },
    {
